<title>USA: Sage management to repurchase stock.</title>
<headline>Sage management to repurchase stock.</headline>
<dateline>NATICK, Mass. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sage Laboratories Inc said its board gave management the authority to spend up to $1 million to repurchase common shares from time to time.</p>
</text>
